        {"op": "read", "reg": "FA", "n": 3, "expect": "83 89 80"},
        {"op": "read", "reg": "F7", "n": 3, "expect": "65 B0 E0"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "driver: Seeed_BMP280 1.0.1 init() and the loop of the gallery example grove-bmp280-xiao-esp32c6, before and after the panel moves",
